@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide empty description
state "Sin línea base" as None
state "BootBaseline" as Boot
state "ClockUnknown" as Unknown
state "RecoveryBaseline" as Recovery
state "Seguimiento confiable\n(compara deltas con gap)" as Tracking
[*] --> None : construct(gap, run epoch)
None --> Boot : primera hora de pared confiable
None --> Unknown : hora de pared ausente\no no confiable
Boot --> Tracking
Recovery --> Tracking
Tracking --> Tracking : delta <= gap
Tracking --> Tracking : delta > gap\n/ ObservationGap
Tracking --> Unknown : hora de pared ausente\no no confiable
Unknown --> Recovery : de nuevo hora de pared confiable
note right of Boot : Las líneas base nunca son\npulsos de admisión
note bottom of Tracking : Un fallo de validación (rango, época,\nregresión monotónica) deja\nel estado sin cambios
@enduml
